<title>ESTONIA: BANK DEPOSITS AND LOANS RISE IN FEBRUARY.</title>
<headline>BANK DEPOSITS AND LOANS RISE IN FEBRUARY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Desposits in Estonian banks rose in February as did credits granted and total bank assets, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that total deposits in banks rose to 15.02 billion kroons in February from 14.34 billion kroons the previous month.</p>
<p>Banks' assets gained to 22.95 billion kroons from 22.07 billion kroons and loans granted to customers increased to 12.75 billion kroons from 11.997 billion kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
